OL,3,GNEWSABlack and Asian runners highlight
OL,4,Aracist abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlack and Asian runners say they have
OL,7,Ffaced racist abuse and unwanted stares
OL,8,Fwhile jogging and sometimes fear for
OL,9,Ftheir safety.
OL,11,FTheir accounts come after running coach
OL,12,FEmma Kirk-Odunubi said she was racially
OL,13,Fabused by some spectators at the Great
OL,14,FNorth Run last week and described it as
OL,15,Fher worst ever experience in a race.
OL,17,FOne man from Gateshead, who is black
OL,18,Fand asked to remain anonymous as he
OL,19,Ffeared further abuse, said he had been
OL,20,Ftold to "go back to your country" while
OL,21,Fout on a run in the area.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
